        "original_id": "9837fed9-670d-5c71-bbd8-aff0e1c1e4dc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Meadowbrook State Parkway, South Oyster Bay, Loop Parkway, mainland, North Merrick\n- Roads: Southern State Parkway, New York State Route 102\n- Topics: transportation connections, population\n\nFacts:\n- The Meadowbrook State Parkway heads north, crosses South Oyster Bay, intersects Loop Parkway, reaches the mainland, and connects to the Southern State Parkway in North Merrick.\n- North Merrick had a population of 12,272 in the 2010 census.\n- New York State Route 102 passes under the Meadowbrook State Parkway without any ramps connecting the two roads.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
